Package: nv-monitor
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: __PKG_ARCH__
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.32), libncurses6 (>= 6.0)
Maintainer: __MAINTAINER__
Description: NVIDIA DGX system monitor (TUI)
 nv-monitor is a single-file terminal system monitor for the NVIDIA
 DGX Spark (Grace ARM CPU + GB10 Blackwell GPU). It combines CPU,
 memory, and GPU monitoring in one ncurses TUI, with optional Prometheus
 export and CSV logging.
